<span id="S4.T1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Quantitative comparisons on the GAIA benchmark.</span>
Tool-R1 achieves the highest accuracy among open-source models across different complexity levels, showing superior sample efficiency and practicality.
The best results are in <span id="S4.T1.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bolded</span>.
