<figure id="S4.F4" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.12867v1/main_com_search.svg" id="S4.F4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:685/306;" width="685" height="306"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 4</span>: </span><span id="S4.F4.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="S4.F4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Case study of Tool-R1.</span>
Tool-R1 dynamically adapts search strategies and executes systematic multi-step reasoning to achieve accurate results, while Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct produces incorrect guesses without proper adaptation.
